{"__q": {"t": "Прошедшие времена — Сборник 2", "q": [{"s": "Choose: «When I arrived, they ___ already ___ .»", "o": ["have / left", "has / left", "had / left", "were / leaving"], "e": "Past Perfect — действие, произошедшее раньше."}, {"s": "Complete: «He ___ football when he was young.»", "o": ["use to play", "used to play", "used play", "is used to play"], "e": "Прошлая привычка выражается с помощью «used to»."}, {"s": "Which is the past participle of «speak»?", "o": ["speaking", "speaked", "spoken", "spoke"], "e": "speak – spoke – spoken."}, {"s": "Complete: «The sun ___ when we reached the top.»", "o": ["set", "sets", "was setting", "had set"], "e": "Действие, длившееся на фоне другого."}, {"s": "Choose: «I didn't ___ anything.»", "o": ["seen", "seeing", "see", "saw"], "e": "После «didn't» стоит начальная форма."}, {"s": "Complete: «They ___ dinner when the guests arrived.»", "o": ["had", "has had", "were having", "have"], "e": "Когда пришли гости, ужин ещё продолжался."}, {"s": "Which sentence is correct?", "o": ["I did knew him.", "I knew him.", "I was knowing him.", "I was knew him."], "e": "«Know» — глагол состояния (state verb)."}, {"s": "Complete: «By 2010 he ___ three books.»", "o": ["had written", "was writing", "wrote", "has written"], "e": "Завершено к определённому моменту в прошлом."}, {"s": "Choose the past of «bring».", "o": ["bringing", "brang", "brought", "bringed"], "e": "bring – brought – brought."}, {"s": "Complete: «What ___ you ___ at 8 p.m. yesterday?»", "o": ["were / doing", "are / doing", "have / done", "did / do"], "e": "Действие, длившееся в конкретный момент в прошлом."}]}, "Past Tenses — 2-ci toplu": "Прошедшие времена — Сборник 2"}